WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Mesure your headphones to define the cardboard dimensions

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Cut out the desired cardboard size

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Fold the cardoard

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Strip the self-adhesive tape

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Tape the folded edges together

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Close both sides of the box

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Place your headphones in the box

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Your box is ready

